{title: Dumplin dumplin}
{artist: Tuyero Submarin}
{year: 2003}
{key: A}
{time: 4/4}

{define: D base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 0}
{define: Adim7 base-fret 1 frets 2 3 2 3}
{define: A base-fret 1 frets 2 1 0 0}
{define: F#7 base-fret 1 frets 3 4 2 4}
{define: Bm7 base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 2}
{define: E7 base-fret 1 frets 1 2 0 2}
{define: A7 base-fret 1 frets 0 1 0 0}
{define: C#m7 base-fret 1 frets 4 4 4 4}
{define: B7 base-fret 1 frets 4 3 2 0}
{define: D+ base-fret 1 frets 3 2 2 1}

[D]· [Adim7]·     [A]· [F#7]·   | [Bm7]·   [E7]·  [A]· [A7]·  | [D]· [Adim7]·     [A]· [F#7]·   | [Bm7]·   [E7]↓

{start_of_verse: Estrofa 1}
Si tu vas para El Callao[A], to see the dance and the Carnaval[A]
You have to go[D] to buy me some dum[C#m7]plings from Mama Jane[B7]
Madama [E7]Jane will blow them up, and you can [E7]buy maybe more than one
But we a[E7]↓wake everybo[E7]dy tries to take them a[A]way
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Estrofa 2}
But if you go to El Callao[A], en los tiempos del Carnaval [A]
Is very hard[D] to find-a hot dum[C#m7]plings from Mama Jane[B7]
Madama [E7]Jane is in disguise, because she [E7]dance and twists so nice
And you don’t [E7]↓know, maybe she [E7]has dumplings under her [A]dress
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[A]Dumpling makes me jump, dum[Bm7]pling makes me dance
Mada[Bm7]ma you take this mor[D+]ning to make me dum[Bm7]pling again
Dum [D]pling I have to take[Adim7], before calyp[A]so begins to play[F#7]
Ma[Bm7]dama you give me [E7]↓dum[E7]↓pling, Isi[A]↓dora’s stealing my dumpling

[A] (Give me my      [Bm7]dumpling     [E7]a[A]gain)  , el Callao man, he wants my dumpling
[A] (Give me my      [Bm7]dumpling     [E7]a[A]gain)  , Carlos Mol is drumming my dumpling
[A] (Give me my      [Bm7]dumpling     [E7]a[A]gain)  , Juvenal is eating my dumpling
[A] (Give me my      [Bm7]dumpling     [E7]a[A]gain)  , oh, yeah!, Erwin John is stepping on my dumpling
[A] (Give me my      [Bm7]dumpling     [E7]a[A]gain)  , wowowow, and the dog is biting my dumpling, baby
[A] (Give me my      [Bm7]dumpling     [E7]a[A]gain)  , Satadan is eating my dumpling
[A] (Give me my      [Bm7]dumpling     [E7]a[A]gain)  , and the class trampling in my dumpling, baby
[A] (Give me my      [Bm7]dumpling     [E7]a[A]gain)
{end_of_chorus}

